  "verified": false,
  "notes": "One RISC-V core at 160 MHz without an FPU and no PSRAM: 2D games and small scenes. Native USB only. SCK 6 and MOSI 7 are SPI2's own pins. GPIO4, GPIO5, GPIO8 and GPIO15 are strapping pins, GPIO12 and GPIO13 are the USB."
